    <!--
      This module had a <build> block whose only purpose was emptying annotationProcessorPaths in
      three places, to escape an entity-meta-processor path the parent once applied unconditionally
      - helper is a dependency of that processor, so processing it with itself is a cycle.

      The escape is obsolete: the processor path now lives in the parent's entity-meta-processing
      profile, which this module already opts out of via .no-entity-meta. help:active-profiles here
      lists only "cicd", so those overrides suppressed nothing. Keeping them would instead strip
      error_prone_core from the inherited path while the inherited -Xplugin:ErrorProne argument
      remained, which fails the compile outright.
    -->
 </project>
